<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia forex reserves ease to $4.1 bln in Dec.</title>
<headline>Slovenia forex reserves ease to $4.1 bln in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Thursday.</p>
<p>FOREIGN EXCHANGE RESERVES</p>
<p>    (in million of dollars)     Dec     Nov	 Dec 95</p>
<p>    Total reserves		4,116.5  4,267.9   3,426.0</p>
<p>    Bank of Slovenia reserves 2,278.7  2,390.6   1,801.6</p>
<p>NOTE: Total reserves are those held by the banking sector as a whole. -- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
